notes.content:
Hello Riders,

This update is polishing edges… Overall game speed is slightly slowed down to reduce chaos on stage.

[h2]Accessibility [/h2]
[list]
[*] Reduced game speed by 10%;
[*] Added one 'Restart stage' per Expedition;
[*] Set default movement scheme (directional scheme) for Gravity stage. [i]Note: thrust-based control scheme will be utilized in another stage-type (runner + scroller) when traveling btw stages;[/i]
[/list]

[h2]Gameplay[/h2]
[list]
[*] Turned off enemy spawners when portal is opened, also turn on loot drops back;
[*] Extracting cargo and explosive boxes gives neuro-bucks;
[*] Increased amount of AI units on gravity stage;
[*] Increased bonus attributes to 3 when completing Galaxy;
[*] Added +6 attribute points to default/stock ship;
[*] Added time bonus exp at gravity stage;
[*] Added impact force for player projectiles;
[*] Rework surround fire module - shoot only in diagonal directions - it should be more powerful and predictable to use;
[*] Reduce miner and healer AI HP;
[/list]

[h2]Misc[/h2]
[list]
[*] Normalized too bright parts of background textures;
[*] Fixed: Explosive units should deal damage to Destructible objects;
[*] Update loading screen hints;
[/list]

Thanks and happy findings!
